{
  "id": "ba948d3e-6d4e-47e8-a85e-ae5fafcb30aa",
  "type": "MULTIPLE_CHOICE",
  "data": {
    "body": "(10 points) Let $T: \\mathbb{R}^{n} \\longrightarrow \\mathbb{R}^{m}$ be a linear transformation with standard matrix $A$. Which of the following statements must be TRUE?",
    "solution": [
      2
    ],
    "answerChoices": [
      {
        "id": "e50e6cff-f6db-4348-9a45-77d946d7dbad",
        "index": 0,
        "body": "$A$ is an $n \\times m$ matrix.",
        "questionId": "ba948d3e-6d4e-47e8-a85e-ae5fafcb30aa",
        "stats": {
          "count": 215
        },
        "resources": []
      },
      {
        "id": "9b08577d-d2a4-4fed-af34-dab1cd9832f7",
        "index": 1,
        "body": "If $T$ is one-to-one, then $A \\mathbf{x}=\\mathbf{b}$ has a unique solution for any $\\mathbf{b}$ in $\\mathbb{R}^{m}$.",
        "questionId": "ba948d3e-6d4e-47e8-a85e-ae5fafcb30aa",
        "stats": {
          "count": 584
        },
        "resources": []
      },
      {
        "id": "fc6629b9-b54a-4b4c-a4f2-62ccbccf414e",
        "index": 2,
        "body": "If $T$ is one-to-one, then $m \\geq n$.",
        "questionId": "ba948d3e-6d4e-47e8-a85e-ae5fafcb30aa",
        "stats": {
          "count": 2576
        },
        "resources": []
      },
      {
        "id": "442e2910-6ec1-4c66-99c7-ec36c7598496",
        "index": 3,
        "body": "The columns of $A$ are linearly independent if and only if $\\operatorname{rank}(A)=m$.",
        "questionId": "ba948d3e-6d4e-47e8-a85e-ae5fafcb30aa",
        "stats": {
          "count": 406
        },
        "resources": []
      },
      {
        "id": "d683f901-3bc5-4572-be82-55e3df6874b2",
        "index": 4,
        "body": "If the set $\\left\\{\\mathbf{v}_{\\mathbf{1}}, \\mathbf{v}_{\\mathbf{2}}, \\ldots, \\mathbf{v}_{\\mathbf{k}}\\right\\}$ spans $\\mathbb{R}^{n}$, then the set $\\left\\{T\\left(\\mathbf{v}_{\\mathbf{1}}\\right), T\\left(\\mathbf{v}_{\\mathbf{2}}\\right), \\ldots, T\\left(\\mathbf{v}_{\\mathbf{k}}\\right)\\right\\}$ spans $\\mathbb{R}^{m}$.",
        "questionId": "ba948d3e-6d4e-47e8-a85e-ae5fafcb30aa",
        "stats": {
          "count": 464
        },
        "resources": []
      }
    ]
  },
